      </div>
      <p>Buying a student laptop in 2026 is more complicated than it should be. The RAM shortage has pushed prices up across the board. Manufacturers are quietly shipping 8GB configurations in devices that should have 16GB. And the marketing of AI features on laptops — many of which require subscriptions to use meaningfully — has muddied what actually matters for coursework, note-taking, and research. This guide cuts through the noise and recommends only what actually delivers value for students, at budgets from 00 to ,000.</p>
